*> The area effect cloud's entity data (docs/protocol/21 section 8.5): metadata 8 radius (Float, the stored radius clamped to 0 to 32), 9 waiting (Boolean, tickCount below the wait time).
*> The metadata 10 (particle) is not sent: the client draws the default particle. The cloud's own tick (CLOUD-STEP, thrown-44.cob) calls CLOUD-DATA-SYNC, which tells the viewers when the radius or
*> the waiting flag differs from what they were last sent (PJ-R3 the radius, PJ-I8 1 + the waiting flag; 0 = nothing sent yet).
*>   CLOUD-DATA-BUILD USING tracker row, slot, PB-BUFFER   the Set Entity Data packet (and records what it says)
*>   CLOUD-DATA-SYNC USING tracker row, slot               send it to the viewers when it changed

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. CLOUD-DATA-BUILD.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY CORESTATE.
 COPY PROJSTATE.
 COPY PROTO REPLACING LEADING ==PB-== BY ==MD-==.
 01 WS-PACKET-ID           BINARY-LONG VALUE 101.
 01 WS-WAITING             BINARY-LONG.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY PROTO.
 01 L-ROW                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-SLOT                 BINARY-LONG.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-ROW L-SLOT PB-BUFFER.
     MOVE 0 TO WS-WAITING
     IF PJ-TICK(L-SLOT) < PJ-WAIT(L-SLOT)
         MOVE 1 TO WS-WAITING
     END-IF
     CALL "PB-PUT-VARINT" USING PB-BUFFER WS-PACKET-ID
     CALL "PB-PUT-VARINT" USING PB-BUFFER EN-ID(L-ROW)
     INITIALIZE MD-METADATA-ENTRY
     MOVE 8 TO MD-MD-INDEX
     MOVE MD-MDS-FLOAT TO MD-MD-SERIALIZER
     MOVE PJ-RADIUS(L-SLOT) TO MD-MD-FLOAT
     CALL "PB-PUT-ENTITY-METADATA" USING PB-BUFFER MD-METADATA-ENTRY
     INITIALIZE MD-METADATA-ENTRY
     MOVE 9 TO MD-MD-INDEX
     MOVE MD-MDS-BOOLEAN TO MD-MD-SERIALIZER
     MOVE WS-WAITING TO MD-MD-INT
     CALL "PB-PUT-ENTITY-METADATA" USING PB-BUFFER MD-METADATA-ENTRY
     MOVE MD-MD-END TO MD-MD-INDEX
     CALL "PB-PUT-ENTITY-METADATA" USING PB-BUFFER MD-METADATA-ENTRY
     MOVE PJ-RADIUS(L-SLOT) TO PJ-R3(L-SLOT)
     COMPUTE PJ-I8(L-SLOT) = 1 + WS-WAITING
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM CLOUD-DATA-BUILD.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. CLOUD-DATA-SYNC.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY CORESTATE.
 COPY PROJSTATE.
 COPY PROTO.
 01 WS-CAPACITY            BINARY-LONG VALUE 64.
 01 WS-WAITING             BINARY-LONG.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-ROW                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-SLOT                 BINARY-LONG.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-ROW L-SLOT.
     MOVE 0 TO WS-WAITING
     IF PJ-TICK(L-SLOT) < PJ-WAIT(L-SLOT)
         MOVE 1 TO WS-WAITING
     END-IF
     IF PJ-I8(L-SLOT) = 1 + WS-WAITING AND PJ-R3(L-SLOT) = PJ-RADIUS(L-SLOT)
         GOBACK
     END-IF
     CALL "PB-INIT" USING PB-BUFFER WS-CAPACITY
     CALL "CLOUD-DATA-BUILD" USING L-ROW L-SLOT PB-BUFFER
     CALL "GI-VIEWERS-SEND" USING L-ROW PB-BUFFER
     CALL "PB-FREE" USING PB-BUFFER
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM CLOUD-DATA-SYNC.
